00:03:13.517 --> 00:03:16.355
Quiz time! Choose the correct answer.

61
00:03:16.655 --> 00:03:18.457
I can blank English now.

62
00:03:18.757 --> 00:03:23.293
A, speak. B, speaks. C, to speak.

63
00:03:27.283 --> 00:03:29.608
The answer is A: speak.

64
00:03:31.117 --> 00:03:33.662
Happy about something you did well means blank.

65
00:03:33.962 --> 00:03:37.151
A, proud. B, tired. C, ready.

66
00:03:41.150 --> 00:03:43.277
The answer is A: proud.

67
00:03:44.783 --> 00:03:47.236
The rules for putting words together are blank.

68
00:03:47.536 --> 00:03:51.607
A, grammar. B, stories. C, words.

69
00:03:55.617 --> 00:03:57.779
The answer is A: grammar.

70
00:03:59.283 --> 00:04:03.758
