71
00:04:09.058 --> 00:04:14.996
The most useful thing I learned is how to talk about my day. I can speak English with my friends now.

72
00:04:15.296 --> 00:04:16.924
Excellent answer, Rithy!

73
00:04:17.917 --> 00:04:22.067
Great work today! You learned eight new words and i can  now.

74
00:04:22.367 --> 00:04:26.679
Today's value is confidence. Speak up and be proud of who you are.

75
00:04:26.979 --> 00:04:32.455
